<PageTitle>Formicarium — Build</PageTitle>

<h1>Build</h1>
<p class="lede">
    One rigid square acrylic column: a heated Ytong nest core hydrated passively from a wicking
    reservoir, three load-bearing risers carrying the outworld above it, and a colour experiment at
    the mouth of each riser. The electronics come out of the fourth face on a drawer without any of
    that being disturbed.
</p>

<div class="build-stamps">
    <span>Species <strong><em>Tetramorium immigrans</em></strong></span>
    <span>Nest target <strong>79–83 °F</strong></span>
    <span>Overall height <strong>26 in / 660 mm</strong></span>
    <span>Status <strong>pre-build, nothing ordered</strong></span>
</div>

